# M16 guest input acceptance, through normal frontend keyboard events.
DOSINPUT
@text q
@key ctrl-c
@enter
@key f1
@key f3
@key f5
@key f10
@key up
@key down
@key left
@key right
@key home
@key help
@key insert
@key delete
@key ctrl-left
@key ctrl-right
@key shift-f1
@key shift-f10
@key shift-up
@key shift-down
@key shift-left
@key shift-right
